# NOTICE — provenance and licensing of each engine

## Authorship

Every line of this repository was written by an AI, working from the original C
sources, with a human directing the work and reviewing none of the code.

Under current US law an AI is not an author and its output cannot be
copyrighted. Whether anyone holds copyright in this code is therefore unclear,
and whether an AI transpilation of copyrighted source is a derivative work of it
is likewise unsettled. There is no precedent for either question. Nothing below
should be read as a legal opinion; it is a record of what is known.

